OL,3,GNEWSAMothers unveil memorial bench for
OL,4,Aknife victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bench has been unveiled in memory of
OL,7,Fyoung people who have lost their lives
OL,8,Fto knife crime.
OL,10,F"This place is very special to me and I
OL,11,Fhope it will be for everyone else who
OL,12,Fneeds this peace," said Tatiana
OL,13,FQureshi, whose son Temur Qureshi, 19,
OL,14,Fdied after being attacked in Slough in
OL,15,FSeptember 2023.
OL,17,FShe joined a group of mothers on
OL,18,FSaturday for the unveiling at Stoke
OL,19,FPoges Memorial Garden.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
